<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The journey involves a set of statutory transit paperwork and risk coverage that protects your belongings and keeps you compliant with Indian regulations.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>For <strong>packers and movers in Hazaribagh</strong> and <strong>packers and movers hazaribagh</strong> clients, the process starts with the GST e‑Way bill.</span></li></ul>

<p>The GST e‑Way bill is a digital way‑bill issued under the Goods and Services Tax Act. It authorises the transport of goods across state borders and records the value, quantity and destination of the cargo.</p>
<p>Without a valid e‑Way bill, the cargo can be seized at the border or face penalties. The bill is generated by the mover’s portal and attached to every consignment that crosses the state line from Hazaribagh to Giridih.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Next, the <strong>IBA‑approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty)</strong> are mandatory for all freight movements.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The LR is a legal document that confirms the loading of goods, the driver’s details, the vehicle number and the agreed freight rate.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>For <strong>movers and packers hazaribagh</strong> and <strong>movers and packers giridih</strong>, the LR serves as proof of ownership and liability in case of loss or damage during transit.</span></li></ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Finally, a comprehensive 100 % declared‑value <strong>IRDAI marine transit insurance</strong> covers accidental collision, fire, theft or unforeseen delays.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Even though the route is primarily road‑based, the insurance is classified under marine transit because it follows the same risk assessment framework used for sea freight.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The policy guarantees full value replacement and covers all incidental costs, giving you peace of mind.</span></li></ul>

<p>For <strong>residential furniture transport</strong> and <strong>trolly trucks for house shifting</strong> between the two towns, the movers will provide a <strong>giridih transport contact number</strong> so you can coordinate pickups and deliveries directly. The package includes:</p>

